      "anchor": "while (true)",
      "condition": "push: insert before first strictly greater cost; update: hop to head if below predecessor, then slide right past cheaper",
      "semantic": "Among equally cheap frontier cells the one found first is expanded first (insertion-order ties, MicroPather's queue); so equal-cost routes always resolve the same way and match the old game's paths.",
